Reliability	Guaranteed delivery (Retransmits lost segments)	Best-effort delivery (No retransmission)
Ordering	Guaranteed in-order reassembly	No ordering guarantees
Header Size	20 bytes minimum	8 bytes fixed
Use Case	Web browsing (HTTP), Email, File transfer (FTP)	Voice calls (VoIP), Video streams, DNS
