Setup Delay	High (Requires signaling handshake)	None (Immediate transmission)
Link Efficiency	Low (Wasted during silence/idle)	High (Bursty traffic multiplexed)
Failure Resilience	Low (If a link cuts, the call drops)	High (Packets routed dynamically around faults)
